# Project 4: Multi-Region Active-Passive Disaster Recovery on AWS

A production-grade Multi-Region Active-Passive Disaster Recovery architecture built entirely from scratch via the AWS Console. This project demonstrates how enterprise companies protect against full region failures using Transit Gateway inter-region peering, Route 53 automatic DNS failover, and S3 Cross-Region Replication.

**Primary Region:** us-east-1 (N. Virginia)  
**DR Region:** us-west-2 (Oregon)  
**Primary VPC CIDR:** 10.0.0.0/16  
**DR VPC CIDR:** 10.2.0.0/16  

---

